        spacing: { before: 0, after: 80 }
      }),
      body("This script is written in your voice with natural contractions. Do not read it verbatim. Read it once to internalize the beats, then speak from your own experience. The structure is the script. The words are yours."),
      spacer(80),
      grayBox([
        "TIMING GUIDE:  Segment 1 (0:00-0:08)  |  Segment 2 (0:08-0:18)  |  Segment 3 (0:18-0:42)  |  Segment 4 (0:42-0:52)  |  Segment 5 (0:52-1:00)",
        "PLATFORM: Zoom Webinar (recommended) or StreamYard into a private Facebook group",
