        "",
        "grab your spot before it fills: [LINK IN BIO]",
        "",
        "or drop your city in the comments and i'll send you the registration link directly.",
        "",
        "#freeworkshop #medspabusiness #medspagrowth #aestheticbusiness #medspaceo #medspacoach"
      ], "Caption"),
      spacer(120),

      // POST 4
      h2("Post 4: The Final Push (Workshop week, 24-48 hours before)"),
      grayBox([
        "PURPOSE: Last call urgency without fake scarcity. Real urgency is the time and the live nature of the event.",
        "VISUAL DIRECTION: Talking-head reel, 30-45 seconds. Bethany on camera, casual and direct. Or a simple countdown graphic.",
        "POST TIMING: 24-48 hours before the workshop"
